github-notice-no-token = No GitHub token is configured, so GitHub is searched by repository name and description only, not by EPUB file name.
github-license-check = Please check your usage rights
github-msg-downloaded = Downloaded { $file }
github-url-title = Paste a URL
github-url-hint = Paste a URL: an EPUB file is treated as one book; a web page is read (that page only) and its EPUB links are listed. You choose the address and judge your own usage rights; the system does not search or crawl by itself and does not bypass login, paywalls or DRM; only http/https and no internal network addresses.
